sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant F as Flask
    participant D as MongoDB

    C->>F: POST /api/v1/auth/login (email, password)
    F->>D: 사용자 조회 (email)
    D-->>F: user document
    F->>F: 비밀번호 검증
    alt 인증 성공
        F-->>C: 200 OK + access_token 발급
    else 인증 실패
        F-->>C: 401 Unauthorized
    end
